# Force LF line endings repo-wide.
#
# This is not a style preference. The fixture canonical form requires \n line
# endings (RFC-0001 §11), and the digest is computed over that canonical form —
# so a conformance fixture checked out with CRLF on Windows hashes differently
# from the same file on Linux. An implementation would then fail the digest
# check for a reason that has nothing to do with the implementation, which is
# the worst kind of conformance failure: it points at the wrong thing.
#
# The CLI repo carries the same rule for the same reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
